sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant Main
    participant Chain as get_rag_response
    participant LLM as LLMFactory
    participant Retriever
    participant Ingestor
    participant BM25
    participant VectorStoreManager
    participant VectorStore
    participant Ensemble as EnsembleRetriever
    participant Embeddings
    participant Index
    participant LLM

    User->>Main: question
    Main->>Chain: ask calls get_rag_response
    Chain->>Chain: strip whitespace and reject an empty question
    Chain->>LLM: create_client(config)
    LLM-->>Chain: provider client
    Chain->>Retriever: Retriever()
    Retriever->>Ingestor: load_documents()
    Note over Ingestor: reads and chunks data/ again, without writing the index
    Ingestor-->>Retriever: documents
    Retriever->>BM25: from_documents, k=5
    Retriever->>VectorStoreManager: VectorStoreFactory.create()
    VectorStoreManager-->>Retriever: Store
    Retriever->>VectorStore: as_retriever(k=5, similarity)
    VectorStore-->>Retriever: VectorStoreRetriever
    Retriever->>Ensemble: BM25 and vector retrievers, weights 0.5/0.5

    Chain->>Chain: ainvoke with the question
    Chain->>Retriever: ainvoke
    Retriever->>Ensemble: ainvoke
    par lexical and vector
        Ensemble->>BM25: ainvoke
        BM25-->>Ensemble: lexical ranking
    and
        Ensemble->>VectorStore: ainvoke
        VectorStore->>Embeddings: embed the question
        Embeddings-->>VectorStore: vector
        VectorStore->>Index: similarity_search
        Index-->>VectorStore: neighbors
        VectorStore-->>Ensemble: vector ranking
    end
    Ensemble->>Ensemble: Reciprocal Rank Fusion
    Ensemble-->>Retriever: fused documents
    Retriever-->>Chain: at most 5

    Chain->>Chain: format_documents builds the context
    Chain->>LLM: prompt plus structured LLMAnswer output

    alt empty, invalid, or truncated output
        Chain->>LLM: retries up to RETRY_ATTEMPTS
    end

    LLM-->>Chain: answer
    Chain->>Chain: assemble_response reads sources from metadata
    Chain-->>Main: RAGAnswer
    Main-->>User: answer, sources, and fragment count
